{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "曲徑求勝",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f81927f530fab8bca96c0aa77eec77136a48530400cd1ed24b4ec0f073b8b91c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "怎麼辦，鼠膽龍威隊遭到了官方設置的伏兵的圍堵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "混戰之中，埃內斯托小弟選擇了殿後，而接過他鑰匙的兩位女俠則繼續向前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "埃內斯托小弟雖然戰鬥力同樣不俗，但是敵人如此眾多，落敗也只是時間問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而反觀兩位女俠這邊，雖然突破了包圍圈，但是前方依然有伏兵，她們真的能夠順利逃脫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "哦？她們打開了路邊一家店的門然後衝了進去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這家店......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "是埃內斯托開的店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "原來如此，看來埃內斯托小弟丟給兩位女俠的鑰匙就是讓她們躲入自己的店中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "但是，這樣真的有效嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "等等，導播，切一下鏡頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "原來如此，從另一角度看過去就明白了，這家店是有後門的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而我們可以看到，後門有一條直通大道的小路，而這條路還沒有被其他阻攔者發現！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這會是鼠膽龍威隊的機會嗎，還是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "D.D.D.的話音未落，螢幕中，埃內斯托的武器店就發出巨大的爆炸聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這、這這這究竟是什麼情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，這也是您設置的障礙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "如果我要設置，那就不是只炸這一家店這麼簡單了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "這......難道是其他隊伍知道埃內斯托小弟有這樣的後手而設下的陷阱？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "如果是這樣，那鼠膽龍威隊這一次可以說是被徹底算計了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "鼠膽龍威隊，難道要折戟於此了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "text": "好過分......陳小姐和林小姐不會有事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "放心，她們兩個都是老江湖，這點爆炸死不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "只不過嘛......雖然這種比賽耍手段不奇怪，但這也有點太針對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳這是和誰結梁子了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵A",
      "text": "......嘖，這傢伙，怎麼回事，根本打不著他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "咦......那邊好像是陳姐姐她們去的方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "還是過去看一看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "陳暉潔，你沒死吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "咳，咳，死不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "沒死就好。你的車呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "好好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "看來，對方也沒想要置我們於死地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "只不過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "湊巧，出口被堵住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好一個湊巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你怎麼看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "想辦法出去，還能怎麼看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我是問，誰幹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我們的直覺看來沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "嗯。埃內斯托看起來忍不住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "但是你不覺得有些奇怪嗎？如果我是他，我不會這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "只有走投無路的人會用這種自爆式的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "要嘛，確實不是他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "要嘛，他想讓我們以為他走投無路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞挑了挑眉毛，沒有接話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "對了，你把這件事告訴坎黛拉女士了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "她怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "您不會做任何事......嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "沒錯，陳世侄，你是個聰明人，你應該想得到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "現在我派人去排查炸彈的話，不是等於在告訴幕後黑手我發現了他的陰謀嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "沒關係，陳世侄，你和林世侄已經做得很好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "老實說，我一開始根本沒有期待你們真的能查出什麼，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "您好像一點都不擔心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "當然，陳世侄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "你也不用太關心這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "我看你和林世侄在大獎賽裡也表現得很好，與其去想這些，不如努努力把第一拿下來，這樣魏彥吾臉上也有光嘛，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們會考慮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你應該想像得到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "確實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "比起這個，怎麼出去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "聽說特別督察組組長在出任務的時候，一怒之下能把房子切成塊，讓我見識一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......不是所有的房子都能那麼切。這座房子明顯用了非常堅硬的材質。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你使沙子的能力能不能搬運一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我又不是我爸，這個堵塞程度，用我的能力也要花一些時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那還是我來試試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不用。我有別的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "什麼方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你猜這是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......炸彈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "還記得我在第一輪找到的炸彈嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "雖然沒有辦法讓坎黛拉女士大規模地去搜查，但是我讓我在這邊收下的小弟裝成小偷去居民區盡可能地偷了一些出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "小偷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "小偷。只要稍微賄賂一下守衛，進去不鬧太大動靜，沒人會管你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "林雨霞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "幹什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "雖然道不同，但我過去一向敬重你與林先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "貧民窟沒有你們撐不下去，這我還是知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不要讓我看到你樂在其中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......陳暉潔，沒有人會主動給自己找罪受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "閃開，我要安裝炸彈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
